{"4964530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seal of Confession", "steam_appid": 4964530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are a priest who hears a confession no one else can. A desperate father plans murder. You are bound by the Seal of Confession; you cannot reveal what you've heard. Meanwhile, you spend the day cleansing old bones. Will you remain silent... or break your vows?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>brief</strong> (around 40 minutes) <strong>psychological horror game</strong> about <strong>guilt</strong>, <strong>duty</strong>, and the <strong>weight of impossible choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game's visual style to your taste, switching between clean visuals and a gritty retro look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/extras/d3cc04732bd6a870677eff6d707414aa.poster.avif?t=1786188676\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/extras/d3cc04732bd6a870677eff6d707414aa.webm?t=1786188676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/extras/d3cc04732bd6a870677eff6d707414aa.mp4?t=1786188676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are a priest who hears a confession no one else can. A desperate father plans murder. You are bound by the Seal of Confession; you cannot reveal what you've heard. Meanwhile, you spend the day cleansing old bones. Will you remain silent... or break your vows?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>brief</strong> (around 40 minutes) <strong>psychological horror game</strong> about <strong>guilt</strong>, <strong>duty</strong>, and the <strong>weight of impossible choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game's visual style to your taste, switching between clean visuals and a gritty retro look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/extras/d3cc04732bd6a870677eff6d707414aa.poster.avif?t=1786188676\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/extras/d3cc04732bd6a870677eff6d707414aa.webm?t=1786188676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/extras/d3cc04732bd6a870677eff6d707414aa.mp4?t=1786188676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "A man confesses he'll kill tomorrow, but the hardest part isn't deciding what's right. It's deciding what you're willing to betray. Work with the Gravekeeper, unaware of the tragedy unfolding around you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/cb0c76e06a11a5444ccf1931507f58dead140c45/header.jpg?t=1786188676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/787676046f8fa2288ecdb29297af09a8f72c5319/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786188676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964530/787676046f8fa2288ecdb29297af09a8f72c5319/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786188676", "w